                                                "sense_id": "4ba42d7e-620b-3c0a-b33d-1bca6083f72a",
                                                "text": "c. 1613–1621, Francis Bacon, The judicial charge upon the commission of Oyer and Terminer held for the verge of the Court\nForethought malice."
